{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17461","headline":"杂言和常州李员外副使春日戏题十首 四 · 权德舆","name":"杂言和常州李员外副使春日戏题十首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"枕上觉，窗外晓。\n怯朝光，惊曙鸟。\n花坠露，满芳沼。\n柳如丝，风褭褭。\n佳期远，相见少。\n试一望，魂杳渺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17461.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17461","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}